{"id": "De4JP9PSnqz", "title": "Video by devanshu.motion", "description": "Kal raat Maa Lakshmi poochhengi, \"Ko jaagarti?\" Kaun jaag raha hai? 🌕\r\n\r\nSharad Purnima, Ravivaar 25 October. Bengal, Odisha aur Assam mein yeh Kojagari Lakshmi Puja ki raat hai.\r\n\r\nKojagari Puja Vidhi:\r\n• Chowki ke chaaron or alpana banaiye\r\n• Maa Lakshmi ko kheer ka bhog lagaiye\r\n• Kheer ko malmal se dhak kar chaandni mein rakhiye\r\n• Tulsi ke paas ek diya jalaiye\r\n• Muhurat: raat 11:40 se 12:31 tak (Drik Panchang)\r\n\r\nAur phir katha, Vishnu Puran (Ansh 1, Adhyay 9) se: Rishi Durvasa ki ek maala, Indra ka Airavat, aur ek shaap jisse teenon lokon se Lakshmi chali gayi. Woh wapas kaise aayin? Part 2 kal subah.\r\n\r\nYeh puri katha Tholu Bommalata mein hai, Andhra Pradesh ki sadiyon puraani chamde ki kathputli parampara. Rang-biranga chamda, ched waale design, aur peechhe deepak ki roshni. Har frame code mein banaya.\r\n\r\nAapke ghar mein Sharad Purnima ki kheer kaise banti hai? Comment mein batao 👇\r\n\r\nSave karein aur parivaar ko bhejein 🙏\r\n\r\n#SharadPurnima #KojagariLakshmiPuja #LakshmiPuja #SharadPurnima2026 #TholuBommalata", "channel": "devanshu.motion", "uploader_id": "25176808901", "uploader": "Devanshu Singhai", "timestamp": 1792845471, "like_count": 16248, "comment_count": 27, "http_headers": {"Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-1763797381548328a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 48.387, "asr": 44100, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://instagram.fblr22-2.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQPVXgC-ArETKvUvy3yH_h06bfzU9hW5-pafImYgJiM0JHvfYk65Pk-nzGFMdyKlj7VqmIwGCijHojZDEgivtIvcRi5rMzR811TAHQM.mp4?_nc_cat=106&_nc_oc=AdrD56hr82UcMBuG8Eir14hpX9iypFbNjRuFTQru6fXUDCZmZfsf--zk7kE-iXjaPuYZz_Iiyo0zAQkZsjNKNLiA&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=instagram.fblr22-2.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=AQVqwSEcL_wQ7kNvwFpLmep&%3D&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=TulmShg839GpLsZ9ZbjnHw&_nc_ss=70689&_nc_map=urlgen_buck